			<div class="page-header">
			<h1 class="entry-title">Deposit &#038; Payment Methods</h1>		</div>
	
	<div class="page-content">
				<div data-elementor-type="wp-page" data-elementor-id="7050" class="elementor elementor-7050" data-elementor-post-type="page">
						<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-74dbfca elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="74dbfca" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-db67288" data-id="db67288" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bd91ae4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="bd91ae4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<p> Para depósitos y/o transferencias para cuentas en mexico adjuntamos datos.</p><ul><li aria-level="1"><b>Mercado Pago (STP)<br /></b></li></ul><p><b>Clabe interbancaria: 722969010369344560</b></p><p><b>Turismo Channel</b></p><p><span style="font-weight: bold;">SWIFT :  <b>722969010369344560</b></span></p><p>Deposits and/or  transfers to accounts in USA, here is the information:</p><ul><li aria-level="1"><b>BANK OF AMERICA</b></li></ul><p>#5860 2689 3841</p><p><b>SWIFT BANK OF AMERICA: </b>BOFA US3N,</p><p><b>ABA </b>026009593</p><ul><li aria-level="1"><b>Transfer by  ZELLE:</b></li></ul><p>Add contact with Email : VANE_2767@HOTMAIL.COM</p><p>On behalf of Vanessa Cardenas</p>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-272533f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="272533f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h5> If you choose to pay with Credit Card. <br>We&#8217;ll send you a digital invoice with a payment link.</h5>								</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-5931051 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="5931051" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
									<h6>A photo of your ID and credit card could be required (shwoing the 4 last numbers and covering CVV numbers) to confirm the purchase.</h6>								</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
